  "reviewRequired": [
    "The SW clothing colour correction has explicit revision-5 approval. All eight individual fits are approved; this combined review does not certify reusable anatomy or a production rig.",
    "Compare body build, head-to-body scale, shoulder/waist/hip balance and leg taper across the separately authored views. Different facing projections are not equal physical-width measurements.",
    "Verify actual accepted head/neck/hair roots, physical hand/side identity and back-facing absence of frontal facial features at native resolution.",
    "Review feet in their own facing: ankle/leg attachment, sole contact and ground baseline. Existing feet remain provisional studies; this review certifies no barefoot, flat-shoe or arbitrary-footwear compatibility.",
    "Do not align, resize, mirror or warp panels to hide authored pose/baseline differences. Any anatomy correction requires a separately reviewed version.",
    "This whole-body fit review does not approve concealed joints, reusable limb partitions, separate garments/material maps, alternate body presets, a production T-pose rig or independently authored pixel artwork. Step 6C stays open; Step 6D has not started.",
    "Future authoring: eventually we may want to create asset by asset from scratch when given a design to avoid masking problems as long as the layering system works."
